    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your wand and develop your own magical build to become the most chaotic chicken on the battlefield. With countless build combinations, annihilate hordes of terrifying hungry frogs and defeat the Bosses to prove your chicken is UNSTOPPABLE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/9bc09a855462473127f25e080ba45725.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your skills into ever more destructive versions and amplify your power on the battlefield. Take your magic beyond the absurd by fusing them to create insane and unexpected combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/b9974761e530ed6dbc24ba392e608b4e.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests across the map and equip crazy accessories from parallel universes. They change your playstyle, grant unexpected bonuses, twist reality \u2014 and above all, make your chicken look absolutely stylish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/25e2023f3c0235fc00513edcb3a1476a.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find fragments of the sacred relics of the Clucktheon. Once complete, bring them to the battlefield to channel this ancient power and unleash the chicken gods\u2019 energy to obliterate frogs mercilessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/327fb818a73214b528482280213b0493.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face insane Bosses, colossal monsters and topple the pillars that hold the frogs\u2019 corrupted reality together. Each battle will push your power to the limit, but for your magical chicken, no Boss is strong enough to stop you from crushing them all.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/343ee68b415d1474f87bd064f89da1fa.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your wand and develop your own magical build to become the most chaotic chicken on the battlefield. With countless build combinations, annihilate hordes of terrifying hungry frogs and defeat the Bosses to prove your chicken is UNSTOPPABLE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/9bc09a855462473127f25e080ba45725.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/60bfe8eb8d0c9c784fca4c8cd88ad1ec.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your skills into ever more destructive versions and amplify your power on the battlefield. Take your magic beyond the absurd by fusing them to create insane and unexpected combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/b9974761e530ed6dbc24ba392e608b4e.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/c468341f5481fc20199eaa7859459ace.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests across the map and equip crazy accessories from parallel universes. They change your playstyle, grant unexpected bonuses, twist reality \u2014 and above all, make your chicken look absolutely stylish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/25e2023f3c0235fc00513edcb3a1476a.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/d710c1e76f8db664864788b464511caa.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find fragments of the sacred relics of the Clucktheon. Once complete, bring them to the battlefield to channel this ancient power and unleash the chicken gods\u2019 energy to obliterate frogs mercilessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/327fb818a73214b528482280213b0493.avif?t=1754920368\" width=620 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.poster.avif?t=1754920368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.webm?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/7cea8e0610780ae5deb85ed06dce0bd2.mp4?t=1754920368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face insane Bosses, colossal monsters and topple the pillars that hold the frogs\u2019 corrupted reality together. Each battle will push your power to the limit, but for your magical chicken, no Boss is strong enough to stop you from crushing them all.</p>",
    "short_description": "A magical, chaotic roguelike-survivor. Craft insane wands, evolve and fuse powerful spells, equip crazy gear, and wield the power of divine relics. Get ready to wipe out hordes of hungry frogs and face mighty bosses in unique, unpredictable runs.",
